plan.md:175:| Bedroom 2 | 25..30 | 18..20 | 2..5 | small |
plan.md:275:| corridor | [23,2,9,24,4,21] | terrazzo | gallery at x=22 z=9..10; living doorway (22,19..20); master bedroom open at z=21/22; doorways (25,2..3,10) bed1, (25,2..3,15) bath 1, (25,2..3,19) bed 2 |
plan.md:278:| bath 2 (en suite to bed 2) | [29,2,14,30,4,16] | smooth_quartz | door (29,2..3,17) from bedroom 2; clerestory x=31 z=15..16 y=4 |
